    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.poster.avif?t=1716723676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.webm?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.mp4?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/3e5e7981422994c680cbd44db6f52afd.poster.avif?t=1716723676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/3e5e7981422994c680cbd44db6f52afd.webm?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/3e5e7981422994c680cbd44db6f52afd.mp4?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE &amp; FIGHT</strong> </h2>Fight for survival: take down bosses, exterminate zombies, fend off other survivors, but remember... Death takes away everything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/83c6c93763a69ef4436c6026a71630ad.poster.avif?t=1716723676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/83c6c93763a69ef4436c6026a71630ad.webm?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/83c6c93763a69ef4436c6026a71630ad.mp4?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE &amp; BUILD</strong></h2>Explore the interactive world and join player factions by day, while building your outpost or participating in raids by night.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/253b6e86032602c1182d59ef693acf6e.poster.avif?t=1716723676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/253b6e86032602c1182d59ef693acf6e.webm?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/253b6e86032602c1182d59ef693acf6e.mp4?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT &amp; LEVEL UP</strong></h2>Intuitively crafting where recipes are gradually unlocked after gathering new resources and components.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Public servers for up to 200 people simultaneously with low latency and a high tickrate.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intuitively understandable craft where recipes are gradually unlocked after gathering new resources and components.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A simple yet versatile construction system with the option for further improvement. Build your base and prepare it for attacks.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Regions with increased radiation.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A skill leveling system that depends on your actions.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gestures and pose animations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>...and much more.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/3e5e7981422994c680cbd44db6f52afd.poster.avif?t=1716723676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/3e5e7981422994c680cbd44db6f52afd.webm?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/3e5e7981422994c680cbd44db6f52afd.mp4?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE &amp; FIGHT</strong> </h2>Fight for survival: take down bosses, exterminate zombies, fend off other survivors, but remember... Death takes away everything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/83c6c93763a69ef4436c6026a71630ad.poster.avif?t=1716723676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/83c6c93763a69ef4436c6026a71630ad.webm?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/83c6c93763a69ef4436c6026a71630ad.mp4?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE &amp; BUILD</strong></h2>Explore the interactive world and join player factions by day, while building your outpost or participating in raids by night.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/253b6e86032602c1182d59ef693acf6e.poster.avif?t=1716723676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/253b6e86032602c1182d59ef693acf6e.webm?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433680/extras/253b6e86032602c1182d59ef693acf6e.mp4?t=1716723676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT &amp; LEVEL UP</strong></h2>Intuitively crafting where recipes are gradually unlocked after gathering new resources and components.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Public servers for up to 200 people simultaneously with low latency and a high tickrate.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intuitively understandable craft where recipes are gradually unlocked after gathering new resources and components.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A simple yet versatile construction system with the option for further improvement. Build your base and prepare it for attacks.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Regions with increased radiation.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A skill leveling system that depends on your actions.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gestures and pose animations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>...and much more.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Survive in a procedurally generated PvPvE world with friends in first-person. Complete quests, craft weapons, build bases, and wreak havoc on enemies.",
